B.Gy=new A.bt(B.aUN,["June's Scheduler","Sign in","Sign in to continue","ID","Password","Create a new ID","Create","Cancel","Save","Delete","Close","OK","Add","Edit","New ID (login name)","Password (min 4)","Display name (optional)","Incorrect ID or password.","Clear cache","Version","App Version","Installed version","Version is defined by the stored build date & time.","Each ID keeps its own separate data. Session is kept for 1 hour.","Accounts used on this device","Tap a name to sign in right away.","Password needed one more time.","Recent","Remove from this device","Removed from this device.","Signing in\u2026","Passwords are stored on this device only and never sent to the server. Clear them on a shared device.","Cache cleared.","First time here? How to use it","What this program is","Open the scout archive","www.scout.it.kr","What is June Scheduler","An ordinary list: write a thing on a line, tick it when it is done.\nThree things were added to that.\n\n\xb7 When a due date passes, a quiet mark stays behind. A trace, not a nag.\n\xb7 For anything involving money, you can write the amount beside it.\n\xb7 Sign in with the same ID and iPhone, Android and PC all show the same list.","Three minutes to get going","Make one ID. Any name you do not use elsewhere is fine.","You start with 14 categories already laid out. Delete them or rename them freely.","Add a task with the + button. Due date, amount and note only when you want them.","Tap the circle to strike a finished task through. Nothing is ever erased.","Sign in from another device with the same ID and the list follows you.","If the screen does not suit you","Tap the icon at the top right to change the design while the list stays visible.\nThe dense themes (Ledger, Terminal, Compact, Matrix, Chrono) draw the list as a table \u2014 30 to 40 lines per screen, so a whole day fits without scrolling.","Where do my notes live","They are saved on the device first, then exchanged with the server (a NAS) while you are signed in.\nIf the network drops, what you typed stays, and the two sides catch up when it returns.\nPasswords are never sent; only a number derived from them is stored for checking.","Who made this","A personal tool, built so that an architecture practice's to-do list and a scout leader's schedule could run on one screen. That is why it does not look like accounting software, and does look like a paper checklist.","Scout materials live at www.scout.it.kr.","Could not open the browser. Please enter the address yourself: {url}",'ID "{id}" created.',"Language","Display","\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4","English","Korean is the default. You can also use English.","Language changed.","Screen theme","Follow phone setting","Light","Dark","Screen theme changed.","Choose a skin","Design theme","Choose a design theme","The same data, a completely different visual language. Colour is chosen inside it.","Colour skin","Paper","Studio E","Desk","Gazette","Ruled paper \xb7 handwriting \xb7 soft corners","Square geometry \xb7 wide caps \xb7 dot grid","Dense list \xb7 edge bars \xb7 round checks","Borderless type \xb7 heavy rules \xb7 editorial","High density (more per screen)","Nothing is lost \u2014 anything dropped from the list is still on the detail screen. Density is layout, not deletion.","Ledger","Terminal","Compact","Matrix","Chrono","Accounting \xb7 zebra \xb7 right-aligned amounts","Log viewer \xb7 upper labels \xb7 densest","Name and check only \xb7 no decoration","Table grid \xb7 cell borders \xb7 reads like a table","Date first \xb7 rules \xb7 built for schedules","{n}x density","Reset every device","Erases this account on all devices. Cannot be undone.","Every task, note and setting for this account disappears from the iPhone, Android and PC at the same time. This cannot be undone.\n\nType RESET to continue.","Type RESET to continue","Every device has been reset.","Reset failed","Skin","Pick an app-wide colour skin (including ruled notebook).","Skin changed.","White","Sage","Notebook","Midnight","Ocean","Sunset","Forest","Handwriting","Handwritten pen font","Pen writing + highlighter, like real note-taking","Handwriting on","Handwriting off","Font","Pick the app-wide font","Windows default","Pen hand","Gaegu hand","Nanum Gothic","Nanum Myeongjo","Gowun Dodum","Jua (rounded)","Do Hyeon (display)","Black Han Sans","Font changed.","Hand-writing fonts are shown slightly larger for legibility","Google Calendar","Google Calendar sync","Send tasks to Google Calendar as events.","Off","Hide the calendar feature","Manual (add from the menu)","Add tasks to the calendar yourself","Auto (sync on save)","New tasks are added on save","Google Calendar setting changed.","Open Google Calendar","Open the month view in a new window","Sent to Google Calendar.","Sync across devices","Turn on auto-sync","Off \u2014 each device keeps its own data","Sync code","Sync now","Copy code","New code","Join by code","Last sync","Connect auto-sync","Enter the code from your PC so both devices show the same data.","Sync server (optional)","Leave empty to use the default encrypted store","Cancel","Connect","Connecting\u2026","Synced","Copied \u2014 enter it on your other device","records","Stored on server \xb7 end-to-end encrypted \xb7 no account","Waiting to upload","{n} change(s) queued \u2014 uploads when online","Everything is stored on the server. This device only keeps a display cache.","Connects automatically when you sign in \u2014 nothing to set up.","Stored on server","Live sync on","Will save again automatically when the network returns.","My own NAS server","NAS address","e.g. http://192.168.0.20:8099 \xb7 leave empty to use the cloud","Shared key (optional)","If the server sets SYNC_SECRET, enter the same value","Save & connect","Test connection","Connected to your NAS","Could not reach the NAS \u2014 check the address and key","Saved. All data now goes to your own NAS.","NAS settings cleared.","Using my NAS","Using the cloud","Clear NAS settings","Your data lives on your own land. See server/gateway/README to install.","Google Drive (upload \xb7 backup)","Back up to Google Drive","Build a backup file and save it to your Drive folder","Upload to Google Drive","Build a file with all current data and upload it","Open Drive folder","Edit Google Drive link","Enter the Drive folder URL to upload & back up all data.","Drive link saved.","Backup created. Save it to your Drive folder.","Upload created. Save it to your Drive folder.","Open Drive folder","Drive folder URL","Could not open Google Drive.","Drive save sheet opened. Pick your folder.","Drive upload page opened.","Could not open Google Drive.","Backup downloaded. Upload it to your Drive folder.","Signed in: {id}","Master \xb7 viewing ALL users","master","All","Tasks","Completed","Nothing completed yet.",'No tasks here. Tap "Add task" to begin.',"Add task","Select a task,\nthen a tab","Assign to:",'Moved "{title}" \u2192 {category}',"Delete task?",'"{title}" will be removed.',"Edit task","Add to Google Calendar","Mark complete","Reopen","Reopen task","Could not open Google Calendar.","Master console","Print / Export","Voice note","Settings","Sign out","New Task","Title","Category","Change theme","Applies instantly, list stays visible","table","chips","Task","Amount","e.g. Pay rent","Note","Details (optional)","Category / Tab","Recurrence","None","Daily","Weekly","Monthly","Day of month","e.g. 12","Amount (\u20a9, optional)","e.g. 2500000","Related to (person / payee, optional)","e.g. Landlord","Pin to top","Long-term","Please enter a title.","Tabs to include","Layout","Prevent two-line wrapping (1 line per item)","Landscape orientation","Line spacing","Font size","Design mode","Muji (plain)","Minimal (underline)","Fancy (graphic)","Whitespace","Image","Print","Send by e-mail","Preview hidden","Hide preview","Show preview","Image export failed: {err}","Change password",'Currently set for user "{id}"',"Session timeout","Kept signed in for 1 hour, then re-login required","Session remaining: ~{m} min","Manage tabs / categories","{n} active tabs","Reorder items","Drag to change the order of tabs","Output items & design","Design: {mode} \xb7 font {pt}pt","Backup all data","Export tasks, tabs, settings & voice notes as JSON","Restore from backup","Paste a backup JSON to restore","Restore from file","Pick a downloaded backup JSON file to restore","Restore cancelled.","Clears logs and cached version info","Reset all content","Delete every task and restore default tabs","Activity log","{n} entries","Forwarding address","Open forwarding site","End the current session now","Master administration","User reports & output",u.X,"Account","Items & Tabs","Output","Data","App","Backup","Restore from backup","Paste backup JSON here","Backup restored.","Invalid backup: {err}","Current password","New password","Password updated.","Check current password / min 4 chars.","Reset all content?","This deletes all tasks and restores default tabs.","Reset","The version string is derived from the stored year, date and time. On a new visit, if the stored version is older, the app clears the cache and downloads the latest data again.","Manage IDs, passwords, and view all users' data","Could not open the site.","Manage Tabs","Add tab","Add menu","Add","Add a new tab (item)","Scroll tabs left","Scroll tabs right","Up","Down","Tab name","Emoji (e.g. \ud83c\udf82)","Top tab: on","Top tab: off","{n} open",'Delete "{name}"?','Tasks in this tab will be moved to "Other".',"Edit tab","Output Settings","Default font size","App theme (screen)","Material (Style 1)","Minimal (Style 3)","Mix (1 + 3)",'Tip: Open "Print / Export" from the top bar to preview and choose tabs, no-two-line, line spacing, orientation, font size and design mode.',"Clear log","No activity yet.","Voice Note","Recording may be limited on web. Type your memo below.","Recording\u2026 tap to stop","Tap to record","Transcript / memo",'Speak or type a quick memo\u2026 (e.g. "Call the bank tomorrow about the loan, also buy paint")',"Summary","Keyword graphic","Save note","Saved notes","Voice note saved with summary.","No content to summarise.","Key points ({n} sentences): {summary}","Master access only.","Master account","{ids} ID(s) \xb7 {tasks} total tasks","View my own data only","View ALL users' data combined","{open} open / {done} done","Show password","Change","Reset","Delete ID","View data","Password \u2014 {id}","Change password \u2014 {id}","New password (min 4)",'Password for "{id}" changed.',"Min 4 characters.",'Password for "{id}" reset to "{pw}".','Delete ID "{id}"?',"This permanently deletes the user and all of their tasks, tabs, logs and voice notes.","Create user","(disabled)","Data \u2014 {id}","No tasks for this user yet.","User Reports","Report type","ID status","By ID (schedules)","By date","Users to include","JUNE'S SCHEDULER \u2014 USER REPORT","ID","Name","Open","Done","Created","\u2014 no tasks \u2014","Prevent two-line wrapping"],t.li)
